<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-KLZ year net profit rises.</title>
<headline>RTRS-KLZ year net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    15.97 vs 15.50</p>
<p>    Net				     12.83 vs 11.80</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		profit 1.59 vs profit 2.81</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     12.0 vs 10.0</p>
